    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323-a2">

                <pb facs="0886" n="672" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg672"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Riotte to Mr.
                        Balladares.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation in
                                Nicaragua</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Leon,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1871-05-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 28, 1871.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francisco Balladares</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.:</hi></p>
                <p>* * * * I beg to advise you that the parcel of documents, pertaining to your note
                    of the 11th instant upon the canal across this republic, came to my hands, and
                    was forwarded to Washington on the 24th instant, and, also, that I have received
                    your dispatch of 15th instant, informing me of the appointment of Mr. Rafael
                    Zurita to be sub-secretary for foreign relations.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. N. RIOTTE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
